# RHF/6-31G* single-point energy of H2O, with SCF population/moment analysis.
# Requests the electric dipole plus Mulliken, Lowdin, and RESP atomic charges.
rhf/6-31g* properties(scf_prop="el_mom,mulliken,lowdin,resp")
geom="""
O   0.000000000   0.000000000  -0.041061554
H  -0.533194329   0.533194329  -0.614469223
H   0.533194329  -0.533194329  -0.614469223
"""
